From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:24:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Maps are used from every world: ids and the list under a
 lock, each map under its own

Audit 2026-11-06 F3: PersistentCollection allocates ids, loads and registers under its monitor and saves from a copy; a WorldMap's trackers, decorations, pixels and renderers are guarded by its monitor, and a holder another thread ticks is left to that thread.

